        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8472, Single Cylinder Lost Wax Bronze Arched Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arched Tuscany Bronze Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a great choice for any restoration project. It has an old world feel, but still manages to look contemporary, so it easily fits into the transitional style that is so popular. The Single Cylinder Lost Wax Bronze Arched Deadbolt is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. Choose from either flat black or medium bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Lost Wax Cast Bronze #11 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Cast bronze collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Arched #11 Tuscany Bronze Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cast-bronze-finish.jpg?v=1704354518\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
