                "description": "The Arched Tuscany Bronze Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a great choice for any restoration project. It has an old world feel, but still manages to look contemporary, so it easily fits into the transitional style that is so popular. The Single Cylinder Lost Wax Bronze Arched Deadbolt is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. Choose from either  flat black or medium bronze finishes.",
